Type: Project
Package: goldenAgeDashboard
Title: Golden Age Politics Dashboard
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Stefan", "Couperus", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2387-1453")),
    person("Martijn", "Schoonvelde", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Interactive Shiny dashboard for exploring how Dutch members of
    parliament used the Gouden Eeuw (Golden Age) as a mnemonic trope between
    1945 and 2024. The dashboard presents 447 coded speeches and supports
    exploration by period, party, speaker, temporal grammar, and symbolic work.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3)
